				<r3d:description language="eng">The SABIO-RK is a web-based application based on the SABIO relational database that contains information about biochemical reactions, their kinetic equations with their parameters, and the experimental conditions under which these parameters were measured. It aims to support modellers in the setting-up of models of biochemical networks, but it is also useful for experimentalists or researchers with interest in biochemical reactions and their kinetics. All the data are manually curated and annotated by biological experts, supported by automated consistency checks.</r3d:description>
